{
  "john.9.p1.b1": {
    "text": "耶稣过去的时候，看见一个人生来是瞎眼的。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 9:1"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "耶⁠稣过⁠去的时⁠候，看⁠见一⁠个人⁠生来是瞎⁠眼的。"
  },
  "john.9.p1.b2": {
    "text": "拉比，这人生来是瞎眼的，是谁犯了罪？是这人呢？是他父母呢？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 9:2"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "拉⁠比，这人⁠生来是瞎⁠眼的，是谁犯⁠了罪？是这人呢？是他父⁠母呢？"
  },
  "john.9.p2.b1": {
    "text": "也不是这人犯了罪，也不是他父母犯了罪，是要在他身上显出　神的作为来。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 9:3"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "也⁠不⁠是这人犯⁠了罪，也⁠不⁠是他父⁠母犯⁠了罪，是要在他身⁠上显⁠出　神的作⁠为来。"
  },
  "john.9.p2.b2": {
    "text": "趁着白日，我们必须做那差我来者的工；黑夜将到，就没有人能做工了。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 9:4"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "趁着白日，我⁠们必⁠须做那差我⁠来者的工；黑⁠夜将到，就没⁠有人能做⁠工了。"
  },
  "john.9.p2.b3": {
    "text": "我在世上的时候，是世上的光。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 9:5"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "我⁠在世⁠上的时⁠候，是世⁠上的光。"
  },
  "john.9.p3.b1": {
    "text": "耶稣说了这话，就吐唾沫在地上，用唾沫和泥抹在瞎子的眼睛上，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 9:6"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "耶⁠稣说了这话，就吐⁠唾⁠沫在地⁠上，用唾⁠沫和泥抹在瞎⁠子的眼⁠睛上，"
  },
  "john.9.p3.b2": {
    "text": "你往西罗亚池子里去洗。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 9:7"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "你往⁠西罗亚池⁠子里去⁠洗。"
  },
  "john.9.p3.b3": {
    "text": "西罗亚翻出来就是「奉差遣」。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 9:7"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "西罗亚翻出⁠来就⁠是「奉差⁠遣」。"
  },
  "john.9.p4.b1": {
    "text": "他去一洗，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 9:7"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "john.9.p4.b2": {
    "text": "回头就看见了。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 9:7"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "回⁠头就看⁠见了。"
  },
  "john.9.p5.b1": {
    "text": "这不是那从前坐着讨饭的人吗？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 9:8"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "这不⁠是那从⁠前坐着讨⁠饭的人吗？"
  },
  "john.9.p5.b2": {
    "text": "是他",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 9:9"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "john.9.p5.b3": {
    "text": "不是，却是像他。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 9:9"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "不⁠是，却是像他。"
  },
  "john.9.p5.b4": {
    "text": "是我。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 9:9"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "john.9.p6.b1": {
    "text": "你的眼睛是怎么开的呢？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 9:10"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "你⁠的眼⁠睛是怎⁠么开的呢？"
  },
  "john.9.p6.b2": {
    "text": "有一个人，名叫耶稣，他和泥抹我的眼睛……我去一洗，就看见了。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 9:11"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "有⁠一个⁠人，名⁠叫耶⁠稣，他和泥抹我⁠的眼⁠睛……我⁠去一洗，就看⁠见了。"
  },
  "john.9.p6.b3": {
    "text": "那个人在哪里？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 9:12"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "那⁠个人在哪⁠里？"
  },
  "john.9.p6.b4": {
    "text": "我不知道。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 9:12"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "我不⁠知⁠道。"
  },
  "john.9.p7.b1": {
    "text": "耶稣和泥开他眼睛的日子是安息日。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 9:14"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "耶⁠稣和泥开他眼⁠睛的日⁠子是安⁠息⁠日。"
  },
  "john.9.p7.b2": {
    "text": "这个人不是从　神来的，因为他不守安息日。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 9:16"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "这⁠个人不⁠是从　神⁠来的，因⁠为他不⁠守安⁠息⁠日。"
  },
  "john.9.p7.b3": {
    "text": "一个罪人怎能行这样的神迹呢？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 9:16"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "一⁠个罪⁠人怎⁠能行这⁠样的神⁠迹呢？"
  },
  "john.9.p7.b4": {
    "text": "是个先知。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 9:17"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "是个先⁠知。"
  },
  "john.9.p8.b1": {
    "text": "这是你们的儿子吗？你们说他生来是瞎眼的，如今怎么能看见了呢？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 9:19"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "这是你⁠们的儿⁠子吗？你⁠们说他生⁠来是瞎⁠眼的，如⁠今怎⁠么能看⁠见了呢？"
  },
  "john.9.p8.b2": {
    "text": "他是我们的儿子，生来就瞎眼，这是我们知道的。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 9:20"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "他⁠是我⁠们的儿⁠子，生⁠来就瞎⁠眼，这是我⁠们知⁠道的。"
  },
  "john.9.p8.b3": {
    "text": "他已经成了人，你们问他吧，他自己必能说。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 9:21"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "他已⁠经成⁠了人，你⁠们问他吧，他自⁠己必能⁠说。"
  },
  "john.9.p8.b4": {
    "text": "他父母说这话，是怕犹太人；因为犹太人已经商议定了，若有认耶稣是基督的，要把他赶出会堂。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 9:22"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "他父⁠母说这话，是怕犹⁠太⁠人；因⁠为犹⁠太⁠人已⁠经商⁠议定了，若⁠有认耶⁠稣是基⁠督的，要把他赶⁠出会⁠堂。"
  },
  "john.9.p9.b1": {
    "text": "所以法利赛人第二次叫了那从前瞎眼的人来，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 9:24"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "所⁠以法⁠利⁠赛人第⁠二⁠次叫⁠了那从⁠前瞎⁠眼的人来，"
  },
  "john.9.p9.b2": {
    "text": "你该将荣耀归给　神，我们知道这人是个罪人。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 9:24"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "你该将荣⁠耀归给　神，我⁠们知⁠道这人是个罪⁠人。"
  },
  "john.9.p9.b3": {
    "text": "他是个罪人不是，我不知道；",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 9:25"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "他⁠是个罪⁠人不⁠是，我不⁠知⁠道；"
  },
  "john.9.p9.b4": {
    "text": "有一件事我知道，从前我是眼瞎的，如今能看见了。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 9:25"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "有一⁠件⁠事我⁠知⁠道，从⁠前我⁠是眼⁠瞎的，如⁠今能看⁠见了。"
  },
  "john.9.p10.b1": {
    "text": "他向你做什么？是怎么开了你的眼睛呢？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 9:26"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "他向你做什⁠么？是怎⁠么开了你⁠的眼⁠睛呢？"
  },
  "john.9.p10.b2": {
    "text": "……莫非你们也要作他的门徒吗？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 9:27"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "……莫⁠非你⁠们也⁠要作他⁠的门⁠徒吗？"
  },
  "john.9.p10.b3": {
    "text": "你是他的门徒；我们是摩西的门徒。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 9:28"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "你⁠是他⁠的门⁠徒；我⁠们是摩⁠西的门⁠徒。"
  },
  "john.9.p10.b4": {
    "text": "……只是这个人，我们不知道他从哪里来！",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 9:29"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "……只⁠是这⁠个人，我⁠们不⁠知⁠道他从哪⁠里来！"
  },
  "john.9.p11.b1": {
    "text": "他开了我的眼睛，你们竟不知道他从哪里来，这真是奇怪！",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 9:30"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "他开了我⁠的眼⁠睛，你⁠们竟不⁠知⁠道他从哪⁠里来，这真⁠是奇⁠怪！"
  },
  "john.9.p11.b2": {
    "text": "从创世以来，未曾听见有人把生来是瞎子的眼睛开了。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 9:32"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "从创⁠世以⁠来，未⁠曾听⁠见有⁠人把生⁠来是瞎⁠子的眼⁠睛开了。"
  },
  "john.9.p11.b3": {
    "text": "这人若不是从　神来的，什么也不能做。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 9:33"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "这人若不⁠是从　神⁠来的，什⁠么也⁠不⁠能做。"
  },
  "john.9.p12.b1": {
    "text": "你全然生在罪孽中，还要教训我们吗？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 9:34"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "你全⁠然生在罪⁠孽中，还要教⁠训我⁠们吗？"
  },
  "john.9.p12.b2": {
    "text": "于是把他赶出去了。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 9:34"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "于⁠是把他赶⁠出⁠去了。"
  },
  "john.9.p13.b1": {
    "text": "耶稣听说他们把他赶出去，后来遇见他，",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 9:35"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "耶⁠稣听⁠说他⁠们把他赶⁠出⁠去，后⁠来遇⁠见他，"
  },
  "john.9.p13.b2": {
    "text": "你信　神的儿子吗？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 9:35"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "你信　神的儿⁠子吗？"
  },
  "john.9.p13.b3": {
    "text": "主啊，谁是　神的儿子，叫我信他呢？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 9:36"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "主啊，谁⁠是　神的儿⁠子，叫我信他呢？"
  },
  "john.9.p13.b4": {
    "text": "你已经看见他，现在和你说话的就是他。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 9:37"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "你已⁠经看⁠见他，现⁠在和你说⁠话的就⁠是他。"
  },
  "john.9.p14.b1": {
    "text": "主啊，我信！",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 9:38"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "john.9.p14.b2": {
    "text": "就拜耶稣。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 9:38"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "就拜耶⁠稣。"
  },
  "john.9.p15.b1": {
    "text": "我为审判到这世上来，叫不能看见的，可以看见；能看见的，反瞎了眼。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 9:39"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "我为审⁠判到这世⁠上来，叫不⁠能看⁠见的，可⁠以看⁠见；能看⁠见的，反瞎⁠了⁠眼。"
  },
  "john.9.p15.b2": {
    "text": "难道我们也瞎了眼吗？",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 9:40"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "难⁠道我⁠们也瞎⁠了⁠眼吗？"
  },
  "john.9.p15.b3": {
    "text": "你们若瞎了眼，就没有罪了；",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 9:41"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "你⁠们若瞎⁠了⁠眼，就没⁠有罪了；"
  },
  "john.9.p15.b4": {
    "text": "但如今你们说『我们能看见』，所以你们的罪还在。",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "cmn-cu89s",
      "ref": "John 9:41"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved",
    "wrap": "但如⁠今你⁠们说『我⁠们能看⁠见』，所⁠以你⁠们的罪还在。"
  }
}
